{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>He shall rule in his house.</b> Master over his wife, and he shall not deviate from the custom of the people of his language, even to speak in another language. And some say that he interwove another matter with this deed, so that there would be no disgrace for the king."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:42.996996991Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}